@startuml
title AudioChat Realtime Pipeline 外部契约时序

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 12

participant "Endpoint Device\n端侧设备" as Device

box "AudioChat Server / Pipeline 外部调用方" #F3F8E8
participant "AudioChatServer.control_ws\n/ws/control" as ControlWs
participant "AudioChatServer.stream_ws\n上行音频连接" as UpstreamWs
participant "AudioChatServer.stream_ws\n下行音频连接" as DownstreamWs
participant "AudioChatApp\n应用编排" as App
participant "ControlService\n事件发布/设备路由" as Control
participant "StreamService\nstream 生命周期" as Stream
participant "AudioChatRealtimePipeline\n统一音频对话管线" as Pipeline
end box

== 1. 建立 audio session ==

Device -> ControlWs: control.user.wake.detected
ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
App -> Control: publish(control.audio_session.open.requested)
Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
ControlWs --> Device: control.audio_session.open.requested

Device -> ControlWs: control.audio_session.opened
ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
App -> Pipeline: open_session(user_id, session_id)
Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.session_ready

== 2. 建立上下行音频长连接 ==

Device -> UpstreamWs: open upstream audio connection
UpstreamWs -> App: stream.input.opened(sensor.mic)
App -> Stream: register upstream stream
App -> Pipeline: attach_upstream(stream_ref)
Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.upstream_ready

Device -> DownstreamWs: open downstream audio connection
DownstreamWs -> App: stream.output.ready(actuator.speaker)
App -> Stream: register downstream stream
App -> Pipeline: attach_downstream(stream_ref)
Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.downstream_ready

note over App,Pipeline
调用 attach_upstream / attach_downstream 之前，
AudioChatApp 已经完成 device、session、stream 的绑定。
pipeline 热路径不重复做身份、session 或 stream 类型校验。
end note

== 3. 连续对话期间只通过 pipeline 交换音频和事件 ==

loop audio_session 未关闭
  Device -> UpstreamWs: sensor.mic audio chunk
  UpstreamWs -> App: StreamChunk
  App -> Pipeline: append_input_audio(chunk)

  alt pipeline emits speech_started
    Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.speech_started
    App -> Control: publish(audio.speech.started)
    Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
    ControlWs --> Device: audio.speech.started
  end

  alt pipeline emits speech_stopped
    Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.speech_stopped
    App -> Control: publish(audio.speech.stopped)
    Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
    ControlWs --> Device: audio.speech.stopped
  end

  alt pipeline emits output_cancel_requested
    Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.output_cancel_requested
    App -> Stream: cancel active output stream
    Stream -> Control: stream.output.cancel.requested
    Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
    ControlWs --> Device: stream.output.cancel.requested
  end

  alt pipeline emits output_audio_delta
    Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.output_audio_delta(bytes, format)
    App -> Stream: write actuator.speaker chunk
    Stream --> DownstreamWs: assistant audio chunk
    DownstreamWs --> Device: assistant audio chunk
  end

  alt pipeline emits output_finished
    Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.output_finished
    App -> Stream: finish current output stream
    Stream -> Control: stream.output.finish.requested
    Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
    ControlWs --> Device: stream.output.finish.requested
    Device -> ControlWs: stream.output.finished
    ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
    App -> Pipeline: notify_output_finished(stream_id)
  end
end

== 4. 下行水位控制 ==

alt endpoint downlink queue high watermark
  Device -> ControlWs: downstream.pause.requested
  ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
  App -> Pipeline: pause_downstream()
else endpoint downlink queue low watermark
  Device -> ControlWs: downstream.resume.requested
  ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
  App -> Pipeline: resume_downstream()
end

== 5. 关闭连续对话 ==

Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.close_requested
App -> Control: publish(control.audio_session.close.requested)
Control --> ControlWs: route to endpoint
ControlWs --> Device: control.audio_session.close.requested

Device -> UpstreamWs: close upstream audio connection
UpstreamWs -> App: stream.input.closed(sensor.mic)
App -> Pipeline: detach_upstream(reason)

Device -> DownstreamWs: close downstream audio connection\nafter local playback drained
Device -> ControlWs: control.audio_session.closed
ControlWs -> App: publish_control_event()
App -> Pipeline: close_session(reason)
Pipeline --> App: PipelineEvent.session_closed

note over App,Pipeline
这张图只描述 pipeline 外部契约。
Text 和 Omni 的内部实现分别在独立 pipeline 内部时序图中描述。
end note

@enduml
